{"title": "Valiant Attack", "pageid": 31153, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Valiant_Attack", "categories": ["Free actions", "Class actions", "Reactions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bardic_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Bardic_Attack.webp/300px-Bardic_Attack.webp, /w/images/2/2e/Bardic_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Bardic_Attack.webp/300px-Bardic_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Bardic_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Valiant Attack</b> is a reaction granted by having a <a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Inspiration\" title=\"Combat Inspiration\">Combat Inspiration</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Add a <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/40px-D6_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/54px-D6_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/D6_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span>+1d6</span> bonus to your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a>. \n</p><p>You will expend your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Combat Inspiration (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Combat Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Combat Inspiration (Condition)\">Combat Inspiration</a> when the effect triggers.\n</p><p><br>\n \n\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_Higher_Levels\">At Higher Levels</span></h2>\n<p>When the <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Valour\" title=\"College of Valour\">College of Valour</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> reaches Level 5, the bonus increases to <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/40px-D8_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/53px-D8_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/D8_Physical.png/26px-D8_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/D8_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span>+1d8</span>\n</p><p>When the <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Valour\" title=\"College of Valour\">College of Valour</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> reaches Level 10, the bonus increases to <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/44px-D10_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/58px-D10_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/D10_Physical.png/29px-D10_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"29\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/D10_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span>+1d10</span> \n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Valiant_Attack\" title=\"Valiant Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Bardic_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Bardic_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Bardic_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Valiant Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Bardic_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Bardic_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Valiant Attack</a> is only available as long as the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Combat Inspiration (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Combat Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Combat Inspiration (Condition)\">Combat Inspiration</a> condition is active.</li></ul>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215046\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 